  "description": "INSPIRED BY THE ULTIMATE\n\nThe Expert shares its design and lines with the Ultimate. Advanced steering angle, short stays and a longer upper tube. Perfect for XC techniques during descents and fast and efficient pedalling.\n\nEVO BRAKE MOUNT\n\nThe rear triangle has been expressly developed to house the EVO Brake Mount system. Their optimal slope angle reduces the vibrations and increases braking power.\n\nRIGID FOR MAXIMUM PERFORMANCE\n\nThe hydroforming technology allows the design of attractive frames in 6061 aluminium alloy with high coefficients of lightness and resistance. The Expert frames combine extra stiffness in their lower area and a high level of comfort and flexibility in the upper tubes.\n\nINTEGRATED CONICAL STEERING TUBE\n\nSteering tube moulded in the same way as the bottom bracket and the rear dropouts.",
